Description: Header files for Linux 7.2.0-sm8850 (OOT module development)
 Kernel headers and Kbuild infrastructure for building out-of-tree
 modules against 7.2.0-sm8850: prepared source headers, generated
 include files, host tool binaries, .config, Module.symvers and
 System.map, under /usr/src/linux-headers-7.2.0-sm8850.
